4069 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 4031 0 R
/E (I am a passionate Civil Engineer with a strong interest in Building Information Modeling \(BIM\) and architectural visualization. Skilled in creating precise CAD drawings and realistic 3D models using Revit, AutoCAD, and 3ds Max, along with high-quality rendering using V-Ray, I focus on delivering accurate, functional, and visually compelling design solutions. My strengths include BIM modeling, technical drafting, and producing detailed visual presentations that effectively communicate design concepts. I am eager to begin my professional career in a dynamic environment where I can apply my technical expertise, creativity, and commitment to contributing to real-world civil engineering and BIM projects.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
